/28 \u00A77: late Iron project (prerequisite depth \u003E= 3) costs 2x the derived cost so research slows toward the end of the age","effects":[{"kind":"build","structure":"frontier_wall_segment"},{"kind":"claim","text":"Border flips \u00D70.5 only across a built segment."},{"kind":"combat","text":"Raid success \u00D70.3 only across a built segment."}],"era":4,"flavor":"A border becomes a line that can be held.","id":"DEF-07","idx":117,"lineage":"DEF","moment":"Masonry joins two boundary markers.","name":"Frontier Walls","practice":[{"action":"build","share":100}],"requires":["DEF-06","TER-08"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":2880,"cost":{"$fix":12369505812480},"cost_reason":"docs/MVP/28 \u00A77: late Iron project (prerequisite depth \u003E= 3) costs 2x the derived cost so research slows toward the end of the age","effects":[{"kind":"build","structure":"castle"},{"kind":"claim","text":"Strong claim anchor, radius 5 under existing rules; garrison required."}],"era":4,"flavor":"A fortified seat holds the surrounding road.","id":"DEF-08","idx":118,"lineage":"DEF","moment":"A keep rises above the river crossing.","name":"Castle Building","practice":[{"action":"build","share":100}],"requires":["DEF-06","BLD-09"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":{"$fix":32985348832000},"effects":[{"kind":"build","structure":"concentric_castle"},{"kind":"defense","mult":{"$fix":6442450944},"structure":"concentric_castle","text":"Garrisoned concentric castle; fitted below the 1.9 storm crossover of e5_combat_oracle"},{"kind":"rule","text":"Siege attrition favors defenders: engine and cannon crews working against a concentric castle suffer 25% more attrition (P)."}],"era":5,"flavor":"Ring within ring, each wall covering the next.","id":"DEF-09","idx":119,"lineage":"DEF","moment":"Two curtain walls rise, one behind the other, around a keep.","name":"Concentric Castles","practice":[{"action":"build","share":100}],"requires":["DEF-08","MEC-06"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":{"$fix":61847529060000},"effects":[{"kind":"build","structure":"bastion_fort"},{"kind":"defense","mult":{"$fix":6442450944},"structure":"bastion_fort","text":"Garrisoned bastion fort, an alternative to the concentric step (castle 1.25 x 1.5 = 1.875, below the 1.9 storm crossover; e6_combat_oracle Part 2); its real job is the integrity track below (P)"},{"kind":"rule","text":"The bastion fort counts as a wall of about 6.75 to 9.0 on the integrity track (1.5 to 2 times a gatehouse wall; a three-cannon train needs 1 to 2 more seasons, e6_combat_oracle Part 1), and engine and cannon crews suffer 25% more attrition; it needs a garrison like a castle. In the sim (docs/MVP/38 \u00A75.6, e6_combat_oracle.py): the bastion wall is 6.75 on the integrity track, defenders fight at x1.5 on top of the castle (1.875 in all, below the 1.9 storm crossover) as an alternative to the concentric step, and the gunpowder wall penalty is NOT halved, because the oracle shows a halved penalty with a x1.5 multiplier closes the storm for good; the crew attrition rule is not built yet (P)."}],"era":6,"flavor":"Angles, not height, turn the shot.","id":"DEF-10","idx":120,"lineage":"DEF","moment":"A star-shaped rampart rises where a round tower stood.","name":"Star Forts","practice":[{"action":"build","share":100}],"requires":["DEF-09","NUM-07","WAR-12"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":{"$fix":1443109011400000},"effects":[{"kind":"prose","text":"Build: Coastal battery. Harbors immune to blockade by unarmored fleets."}],"era":7,"id":"DEF-11","idx":121,"lineage":"DEF","name":"Coastal Fortifications","requires":["DEF-10","SEA-14"],"status":"draft","theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":{"$fix":8761733283500000},"effects":[{"kind":"prose","text":"Defensive lines: front-line tiles near-impossible to flip by infantry."}],"era":8,"id":"DEF-12","idx":122,"lineage":"DEF","name":"Trenches \u0026 Wire","requires":["DEF-11","MET-15"],"status":"draft","theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":{"$fix":8761733283500000},"effects":[{"kind":"prose","text":"Build: Radar station. Air raids \u221260%."}],"era":8,"id":"DEF-13","idx":123,"lineage":"DEF","name":"Radar \u0026 Air Defense","requires":["DEF-12","WAY-12"],"status":"draft","theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":{"$fix":10952166604800000},"effects":[{"kind":"prose","text":"Rivals cannot declare war of conquest on you (raids and proxy pressure still possible)."}],"era":8,"id":"DEF-14","idx":124,"lineage":"DEF","name":"Nuclear Deterrence","requires":["DEF-13","WAR-16"],"status":"draft","theme":"reach","type":"I"},{"cost":{"$fix":38654705664000000},"effects":[{"kind":"prose","text":"Protects data infrastructure: sabotage of your Apex uplinks \u221280%."}],"era":9,"id":"DEF-15","idx":125,"lineage":"DEF","name":"Cyber Defense","requires":["DEF-13","COM-16"],"status":"draft","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":94489280512},"effects":[{"kind":"diplo","text":"violent first contacts \u221250%"},{"kind":"rule","text":"default stance to strangers: wary, not hostile"}],"era":0,"flavor":"Stranger, not enemy. Not yet.","id":"DIP-01","idx":126,"lineage":"DIP","moment":"Two strangers, palms open, circling each other slowly","name":"Stranger Greetings","practice":[{"action":"meet_strangers","share":100}],"requires":["COM-01"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"D"},{"cost":{"$fix":322122547200},"effects":[{"kind":"rule","text":"guests welcomed: contact \u2192 diffusion begins"},{"kind":"relations","text":"\u002B5 per peaceful encounter"}],"era":1,"flavor":"A guest is sacred.","id":"DIP-02","idx":127,"lineage":"DIP","moment":"A stranger is given the warm place by the fire","name":"Hospitality Customs","practice":[{"action":"meet_strangers","share":100}],"requires":["DIP-01","SOC-03"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"I"},{"cost":{"$fix":966367641600},"effects":[{"kind":"diplo","text":"Alliance: no fighting, shared diffusion, joint defense"}],"era":2,"flav