,"theme":"reach","type":"S"},{"cost":1200,"cost":{"$fix":5153960755200},"cost_reason":"docs/MVP/28 \u00A716: late era-3 project (prerequisite depth \u003E= 3) costs 2x the derived cost so research slows toward the end of the age","effects":[{"kind":"build","structure":"caravanserai"},{"kind":"rule","text":"a Town on 2 or more trade routes: food cap \u002B25%"},{"kind":"mod","op":"mult","stat":"route_capacity","value":2},{"cap":"food","kind":"cap","mult":{"$fix":4509715660}}],"era":3,"flavor":"Where roads meet, a town grows.","id":"TRD-05","idx":444,"lineage":"TRD","moment":"Caravans from three directions unload in a walled yard beside the market","name":"Market Towns","practice":[{"action":"trade","share":50},{"action":"haul","share":50}],"requires":["TRD-04","TRN-05"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"I"},{"cost":{"$fix":5153960755200},"effects":[{"kind":"mod","op":"mult","stat":"trade_friction","value":{"$fix":2576980377}},{"kind":"admin","note":"Tax/coin administration capacity.","span":1}],"era":4,"flavor":"A shared mark settles an exchange.","id":"TRD-06","idx":445,"lineage":"TRD","moment":"A stamped coin is weighed at the market.","name":"Coinage","practice":[{"action":"trade","share":100}],"requires":["TRD-05","MET-03"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":15461882265600},"cost":3600,"cost_reason":"docs/MVP/28 \u00A77: late Iron project (prerequisite depth \u003E= 3) costs 2x the derived cost so research slows toward the end of the age","effects":[{"kind":"reach","text":"Route range \u00D73 for caravan or harbor-to-harbor mode; only available mode is active; no free cargo, route or import."}],"era":4,"flavor":"A chain of routes joins far markets.","id":"TRD-07","idx":446,"lineage":"TRD","moment":"A caravan and ship exchange cargo at a distant port.","name":"Long-Distance Trade Routes","practice":[{"action":"trade","share":100}],"requires":["TRD-06"],"requires_any":["HUS-09","SEA-07"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"I"},{"cost":{"$fix":41231686041600},"effects":[{"kind":"mod","note":"credit moves existing goods sooner; it creates none","op":"mult","stat":"trade_volume","value":{"$fix":6442450944}},{"kind":"mod","note":"Wonder funding: build 15% faster","op":"mult","stat":"wonder_build_labor","value":{"$fix":3734903560}},{"kind":"rule","text":"Bills of exchange settle between markets linked by a route; they mint no coin and no goods."}],"era":5,"flavor":"A promise travels where coin cannot.","id":"TRD-08","idx":447,"lineage":"TRD","moment":"A merchant signs a bill that a distant banker will honor.","name":"Banking","practice":[{"action":"trade","share":100}],"requires":["TRD-07","NUM-08"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"I"},{"cost":12800,"cost":{"$fix":54975581388800},"cost_reason":"docs/MVP/27 \u00A76 D9 and docs/MVP/28 \u00A716: depth-3 non-keystone E5 project; 2x EraBase 6400 x M 1.0.","effects":[{"kind":"mod","op":"mult","stat":"trade_profit","value":{"$fix":5153960755}},{"kind":"mod","op":"mult","stat":"admin_waste","value":{"$fix":3865470566}},{"kind":"rule","text":"KEY-6 prerequisite."}],"era":5,"flavor":"Every debit finds its twin.","id":"TRD-09","idx":448,"lineage":"TRD","moment":"A clerk enters a sum on both pages of a ledger.","name":"Double-Entry Bookkeeping","practice":[{"action":"trade","share":50},{"action":"count_stores","share":50}],"requires":["TRD-08","NUM-09"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":77309411328000},"effects":[{"kind":"mod","note":"overseas ventures, colonies and big works funded from pooled goods (P)","op":"mult","stat":"venture_speed","value":{"$fix":6442450944}},{"kind":"rule","text":"Joint-stock pools existing goods into one voyage ledger; it creates no money and no debt (decision D12: pooled goods only). In the sim it needs at least two harbor towns to pool, and then sea ventures sail x1.5 faster. KEY-7 prerequisite."}],"era":6,"flavor":"Many purses, one ship.","id":"TRD-10","idx":449,"lineage":"TRD","m