own stone drives off a prowling wolf","name":"Clubs \u0026 Thrown Stones","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":100}],"requires":["WOD-01"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":322122547200},"effects":[{"action":"raid","kind":"unlock_action","note":"steal stores, burn, capture camps; 13 \u00A75"}],"era":1,"flavor":"What they have, we can take.","id":"WAR-02","idx":474,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"Painted warriors slip through the grass at dawn","name":"Raiding","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":50},{"action":"hunt","share":50}],"requires":["WAR-01","HNT-04"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"I"},{"cost":{"$fix":214748364800},"effects":[{"kind":"combat","text":"ranged \u00D71.5"},{"kind":"defense","text":"defenders behind barriers \u00D72"}],"era":1,"flavor":"The bow made the few the many.","id":"WAR-03","idx":475,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"Arrows arc over a thorn barrier","name":"Archery Warfare","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-02","HNT-06"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":515396075400},"effects":[{"id":"warrior","kind":"role"},{"kind":"mod","note":"Raid success, \u002B40%","op":"pct","stat":"raid_success","value":{"$fix":1717986918}},{"kind":"rule","text":"border patrols: presence along borders"}],"era":2,"flavor":"Some of us live for war.","id":"WAR-04","idx":476,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"Warriors paint their faces before a raid","name":"Warrior Bands","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-03","SOC-05"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"R"},{"cost":{"$fix":1717986918400},"effects":[{"id":"G-ARMS2A","kind":"good","note":"0.3 L arsenical bronze, weapon 2.1, shield"},{"id":"G-ARMS2T","kind":"good","note":"0.3 L tin bronze, weapon 2.3, shield"},{"kind":"combat","text":"shields: casualties taken \u00D7(1 \u2212 0.3 \u00D7 share of the side\u0027s fighters with an ARMS2 kit)"},{"kind":"rule","text":"militia carry the settlement\u0027s spare arms kits, then its best stocked spear (spares: 2, or 25% of adults under Fortify)"}],"era":3,"flavor":"Bronze in the hand, the shield on the arm.","id":"WAR-05","idx":477,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"A line of warriors locks shields; spear points gleam gold above them","name":"Bronze Arms \u0026 Shields","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":50},{"action":"smelt","share":50}],"requires":["WAR-04"],"requires_any":["MET-04","MET-05"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":1717986918400},"effects":[{"id":"G-CHARIOT","kind":"good","note":"2 horses, 2 wheels, 2 L wood, 0.2 L bronze"},{"kind":"combat","text":"chariot crew \u00D72 strength on open terrain, crew casualties \u00D70.5; no effect against walls or hillforts"},{"kind":"rule","text":"raids with chariots: surprise \u002B10 points, travel \u00D71.5"}],"era":3,"flavor":"Thunder on the open plain.","id":"WAR-06","idx":478,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"A chariot wheels across the plain, the archer braced as the driver lashes the horses","name":"Chariots","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":50},{"action":"ride","share":50}],"requires":["WAR-05","TRN-05","HUS-07"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":7730941132800},"effects":[{"id":"soldier","kind":"role","note":"Base ceiling 10% of adults; standing role requires staffing, training and supply."},{"kind":"combat","text":"Professional training replaces ordinary multiplier with \u00D71.5; garrison claims require staffing and supply."}],"era":4,"flavor":"Practice makes a standing force.","id":"WAR-07","idx":479,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"Recruits drill in a common formation.","name":"Professional Armies","practice":[{"action":"guard","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-05","GOV-07"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"I"},{"cost":2400,"cost":{"$fix":10307921510400},"cost_reason":"docs/MVP/28 \u00A77: late Iron project (prerequisite depth \u003E= 3) costs 2x the derived cost so research slows toward the end of the age","effects":[{"id":"G-ARMS3","kind":"good"},{"kind":"combat","text":"Soldier capacity ceiling rises from 10% to 20% of adults; iron weapon strength 2.4; MET-10 steel edge raises it once to 3.0 (\u00D71.25)."}],"era":4,"flavor":"More people can be equipped if the state can supply them.","id":"WAR-08","idx":480,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"An iron sword is issued beside a ration.","name":"Iron Weapons","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-07","MET-09"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":2400,"cost":{"$fix":10307921510400},"cost_reason":"docs/MVP/28 \u00A77: late Iron project (prerequisite depth \u003E= 3) costs 2x the derived cost so research slows toward the end of the age","effects":[{"id":"G-ENGINE","kind":"good"},{"action":"siege_assault","kind":"unlock_action"},{"kind":"combat","text":"Supplied engine assault reduces matched siege duration to \u00D70.40; requires engine, crew, transport, supply and time."}],"era":4,"flavor":"A wall now has a measured weakness.","id":"WAR-09","idx":481,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"A counterweighted arm throws a stone against a wall.","name":"Siege Engines","practice":[{"action":"guard","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-07","MEC-05"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":27487790694400},"effects":[{"id":"knight","kind":"role"},{"kind":"combat","text":"Mounted shock troops: strength x2 in open battle only (never in an assault on a wall or a storm); needs a horse, G-HORSESHOE and steel arms; at most a quarter of soldier slots (P)."}],"era":5,"flavor":"A charge is a weight that arrives.","id":"WAR-10","idx":482,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"Armored riders couch their lances and thunder across a field.","name":"Heavy Cavalry","practice":[{"action":"ride","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-08","TRN-09"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":27487790694400},"effects":[{"id":"G-CROSSBOW","kind":"good"},{"id":"G-LONGBOW","kind":"good"},{"kind":"combat","text":"Levy ranged weapon: strength 2.0 for an undrilled levy (P), fires a first-round volley, and bolts ignore the shield casualty reduction; peasant levies are effective."}],"era":5,"flavor":"A farmer learns the crossbow in a week.","id":"WAR-11","idx":483,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"A line of levies cranks and levels crossbows.","name":"Crossbows \u0026 Longbows","practice":[{"action":"fight","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-08","MEC-07"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":12800,"cost":{"$fix":54975581388800},"cost_reason":"docs/MVP/27 \u00A76 D9 and docs/MVP/28 \u00A716: depth-3 non-keystone E5 project; 2x EraBase 6400 x M 1.0.","effects":[{"id":"gunner","kind":"role"},{"id":"G-CANNON","kind":"good"},{"action":"fire_cannon","kind":"unlock_action"},{"kind":"build","structure":"arsenal"},{"kind":"combat","text":"A cannon (4 crew, 0.25 powder per shot, P) does twice an engine\u0027s damage to wall integrity each season (e5_combat_oracle reading B); walls count for less in the storm that follows a breach. Cannons and gunpowder are made at the Arsenal: one per civilization, a town of 60 or more with a forge (docs/MVP/37)."}],"era":5,"flavor":"Thunder is taught to break walls.","id":"WAR-12","idx":484,"lineage":"WAR","moment":"A gunner touches a match and a wall shudders.","name":"Gunpowder Weapons","practice":[{"action":"fire_cannon","share":100}],"requires":["WAR-11","CHM-07"],"status":"numeric","theme":"reach","type":"M"},{"cost":{"$fix":51539607552000},"effects":[{"kind":"mod","note":"a drilled national levy with muskets; needs GOV-12 (P)","op":"mult","stat":"levy_strength","value":{"$fix":6442450944}},{"kind":"combat","text":"Pike and musket drill is a fixed-ratio row on the existing combat tables, fitted against the F-T5 force tables (P). In the sim a civilization with WAR-13 and GOV-12 fights its levy (not its professionals or warriors) at x1.5 (e6_combat_oracle.py Part 3)."}],"era":6,"flavor":"The line holds because every man knows his place.","id":"WAR-13","idx":485,"